WEBVTT

00:00.990 --> 00:06.930
Zankoku na tenshi no you ni

00:00.990 --> 00:06.930
Just like the cruel angel

00:06.930 --> 00:14.590
Shounen yo shinwa ni nare

00:06.930 --> 00:14.590
Young boy, become a legend

00:18.990 --> 00:22.410
2D4U PRESENTS:

00:22.770 --> 00:25.810
Aoi kaze ga ima

00:22.770 --> 00:25.810
Even though the untested breeze...

00:25.810 --> 00:29.510
mune no doa o tataitemo

00:25.810 --> 00:29.510
...taps at the door to your heart

00:29.510 --> 00:36.970
Watashi dake o tada mitsumete hohoenderu anata

00:29.510 --> 00:36.970
You just look solely at me and smile

00:37.560 --> 00:44.500
Sotto fureru mono motomeru koto ni muchuu de

00:37.560 --> 00:44.500
So intent on seeking out that gentle touch

00:44.500 --> 00:51.400
Unmei sae mada shiranai itaike na hitomi

00:44.500 --> 00:51.400
Such innocent eyes, still ignorant of their destiny

00:52.000 --> 00:55.750
Dakedo itsuka kizuku deshou

00:52.000 --> 00:55.750
But someday, you are sure to realize...

00:55.750 --> 00:58.340
sono senaka ni wa

00:55.750 --> 00:58.340
...that upon your back

00:59.510 --> 01:02.960
Haruka mirai mezasu tame

00:59.510 --> 01:02.960
You have the wings with which to fly...

01:02.960 --> 01:06.310
no hane ga aru koto

01:02.960 --> 01:06.310
...towards the distant future

01:06.990 --> 01:10.690
Zankoku na tenshi no teeze

01:06.990 --> 01:10.690
The cruel angel's thesis

01:10.690 --> 01:14.430
Madobe kara yagate tobidatsu

01:10.690 --> 01:14.430
Soon, you will take flight from the windowsill

01:14.430 --> 01:18.200
Hotobashiru atsui patosu de

01:14.430 --> 01:18.200
With your torrent of ardent pathos

01:18.200 --> 01:21.900
Omoide o uragiru nara

01:18.200 --> 01:21.900
If you are to betray our memories

01:21.900 --> 01:25.540
Kono sora o daite kagayaku

01:21.900 --> 01:25.540
You, who embrace these heavens and shine

01:25.540 --> 01:29.270
Shounen yo shinwa ni nare

01:25.540 --> 01:29.270
Young boy, become a legend

01:55.090 --> 01:57.430
Where's Asuka?

01:57.430 --> 02:01.930
She's already left. It would seem that
she's determined not to see me.

02:02.260 --> 02:04.020
Why?

02:04.020 --> 02:07.060
Shinji, I guess you're still too young
to understand a woman's feelings.

02:10.100 --> 02:11.730
Well...
By the way...

02:11.730 --> 02:13.360
Go ahead.

02:13.360 --> 02:16.900
Is the rumor that Unit 04 went missing true?

02:16.900 --> 02:19.700
I heard that there was some kind
of accident, and it exploded.

02:19.700 --> 02:21.910
Yes, it's true.

02:21.910 --> 02:25.660
Unit 04 vanished, along with
the Second Branch of Nerv.

02:25.660 --> 02:28.410
It happened while they were
testing the S2 engine.

02:28.410 --> 02:30.080
But don't worry, we'll be all right here.

02:30.080 --> 02:32.250
All three of our Evas are functioning properly.

02:32.250 --> 02:34.670
And we have a crack team of pilots and staff.

02:34.670 --> 02:37.630
But I heard that Unit 03 is being
brought here from America.

02:37.630 --> 02:39.930
You're performing the activation tests
at Matsushiro, aren't you?

02:40.680 --> 02:42.800
I'll be out for four days or so,

02:42.800 --> 02:45.640
but Kaji will be taking care of you two,
so don't worry.

02:45.640 --> 02:46.890
But what about the test?

02:46.890 --> 02:48.520
Ritsuko will be there as well, after all.

02:48.520 --> 02:50.060
There won't be any problems.

02:50.060 --> 02:51.190
But what about the pilot?

02:52.610 --> 02:55.320
Well, about the pilot...

03:02.240 --> 03:03.740
Yes?

03:03.740 --> 03:05.080
Good morning!

03:05.700 --> 03:08.830
I've come today with a request, Major Katsuragi!

03:09.330 --> 03:13.790
Please! Make me the pilot
for Evangelion Unit 03!

03:15.340 --> 03:18.300
EPISODE 18
SELECTION
OF LIFE

03:21.930 --> 03:24.390
So, Shinji doesn't know yet?

03:24.390 --> 03:27.270
Finding the right time to tell him...

03:27.270 --> 03:28.600
I'm scared.

03:28.600 --> 03:31.810
Sometimes I just can't tell
what the heck he's thinking.

03:31.810 --> 03:33.480
Pull yourself together.

03:33.480 --> 03:35.940
You're the one who volunteered
to be his guardian.

03:35.940 --> 03:38.530
I know, but...

03:38.530 --> 03:40.860
So when are you calling in the pilot?

03:40.860 --> 03:44.740
I think that'll be tomorrow.
There are a lot of things to prep, after all.

03:45.660 --> 03:48.290
He might tell Shinji himself.

03:48.290 --> 03:49.950
I don't think so.

03:49.950 --> 03:52.960
He wasn't enthused enough
to be bragging about it.

03:52.960 --> 03:56.790
Getting his sister transferred to
our hospital here at Headquarters

03:56.790 --> 03:59.010
was the one condition he gave.

04:00.050 --> 04:02.840
Man, Miss Misato sure can be cold.

04:02.840 --> 04:05.050
I'm number one when it comes to enthusiasm,

04:05.050 --> 04:07.640
so she could at least use me,
even if it's just as a backup.

04:07.640 --> 04:09.140
Right, Toji?

04:15.020 --> 04:19.150
What happened? You left before me,
but you're awfully late.

04:19.150 --> 04:22.150
What, no marital spat today?

04:23.950 --> 04:26.820
I just didn't want to see your ugly faces!

04:26.820 --> 04:28.160
You three damn stooges!

04:34.790 --> 04:37.250
Now, time to eat!

04:37.250 --> 04:39.170
Hey, where's Toji?

04:39.170 --> 04:40.550
He's gone.

04:40.550 --> 04:43.380
Without even eating lunch? Him?

04:43.380 --> 04:45.300
That's impossible.

04:46.390 --> 04:48.600
He's been acting odd lately, hasn't he?

04:53.520 --> 04:55.270
Suzuhara...

04:55.900 --> 05:00.070
Oh, Ayanami, if you're lookin' for Shinji,
he ain't here.

05:01.900 --> 05:04.490
You know 'bout me, don't you?

05:04.490 --> 05:06.110
Seems Sohryu knows too.

05:08.490 --> 05:10.870
So Shinji's the only one who doesn't know.

05:11.740 --> 05:14.210
You don't usually care 'bout people.

05:14.500 --> 05:17.580
Really? I'm not sure I understand.

05:17.580 --> 05:19.920
The one you care about's Shinji.

05:19.920 --> 05:21.500
Do I?

05:21.840 --> 05:23.880
You may be right.

05:23.880 --> 05:25.220
Yeah, you do.

05:28.390 --> 05:30.220
Hikari!

05:30.220 --> 05:31.760
Let's have lunch!

05:32.720 --> 05:36.560
Two hours late, and then, finally, he arrives.

05:36.560 --> 05:39.900
He's the first guy to ever make me
wait this long.

05:39.900 --> 05:42.900
Yeah, because you never waited for the guy
when you were dating, right?

05:43.820 --> 05:48.780
And so this was the so-called Second Impact.

05:48.780 --> 05:52.160
At that time I was living in a place
called Nebukawa,

05:52.160 --> 05:56.080
but the rising water levels caused
by the melting of Antarctica

05:56.080 --> 05:59.000
have submerged it beneath the sea.

06:00.080 --> 06:04.130
Sorry, transfer student,
but I've gotta beat you up!

06:04.670 --> 06:07.470
I won't feel right until I've smacked you.

06:16.730 --> 06:20.650
I'm sorry, Asuka. You always
walk home with Ikari.

06:20.650 --> 06:23.690
Forget it. The only reason I'm with Shinji
is because of work.

06:23.690 --> 06:26.400
And I don't feel like seeing him today anyway.

06:30.030 --> 06:32.070
This is about Suzuhara, isn't it?

06:32.070 --> 06:33.780
Yes. You could tell?

06:33.780 --> 06:35.120
It's obvious.

06:35.120 --> 06:38.120
The three stooges are about
the only ones who don't see it.

06:38.120 --> 06:40.460
But Ikari seems naïve.

06:40.460 --> 06:42.460
Actually, he's the most dense of them all.

06:42.460 --> 06:44.050
And he's an idiot to boot.

06:44.050 --> 06:46.170
He doesn't know how to relate to people.

06:46.510 --> 06:47.800
Really?

06:52.550 --> 06:56.390
I think Suzuhara might like Miss Ayanami.

06:56.390 --> 06:59.890
Suzuhara does?! Miss Perfect?!

06:59.890 --> 07:02.520
They seemed to be getting along during lunch.

07:02.520 --> 07:05.400
Don't worry, Hikari. There's no way.

07:05.400 --> 07:09.240
She's a million times denser than Shinji is
about relating to people!

07:09.240 --> 07:10.400
Really?

07:10.400 --> 07:11.450
Really!

07:14.330 --> 07:16.080
Can I ask you one thing?

07:16.080 --> 07:17.160
What?

07:17.160 --> 07:19.580
What do you see in that hot-headed stooge?

07:22.920 --> 07:24.630
His kindness...

07:36.640 --> 07:37.850
Come to think of it...

07:37.850 --> 07:39.930
Kaji sure spends a lot of time in the tub.

07:42.730 --> 07:45.110
I wonder who's going to pilot Unit 03?

07:46.020 --> 07:47.860
You mean you haven't heard yet?

07:47.860 --> 07:48.440
Who is it?

07:52.910 --> 07:54.320
I don't know.

07:55.410 --> 07:57.030
That was refreshing!

07:57.450 --> 08:00.040
What? Are you two fighting again?

08:00.040 --> 08:01.210
You guys are hopeless.

08:01.210 --> 08:03.250
Are you two always like this
when Katsuragi's gone?

08:03.250 --> 08:04.420
No!

08:04.420 --> 08:08.840
I get to spend the night with you, after all,
so I'd love to be all happy and smiling.

08:09.420 --> 08:12.510
But I can't do it tonight. I just can't.

08:15.300 --> 08:18.100
I understand. Let's go to bed.

08:18.100 --> 08:20.890
Going to bed early is the best thing
for these situations.

08:27.820 --> 08:30.400
Are you asleep yet, Kaji?

08:30.400 --> 08:32.490
No, not yet.

08:32.950 --> 08:35.740
What's my father like?

08:35.740 --> 08:37.780
Well, that came out of nowhere.

08:37.780 --> 08:40.290
I thought you'd ask about Katsuragi.

08:40.290 --> 08:42.830
Because it seems like you're
always with my father.

08:43.250 --> 08:45.750
It's the Vice Commander who's always with him.

08:45.750 --> 08:48.500
Have you been asking around
about your father?

08:49.300 --> 08:52.420
Because I haven't been around him much.

08:52.420 --> 08:54.010
So you don't really know him?

08:54.470 --> 08:58.350
But I've learned a lot about him lately.

08:58.640 --> 09:02.980
About his work, about my mother, so...

09:02.980 --> 09:06.270
You're wrong there. You only
believe that you've learned.

09:07.150 --> 09:09.980
People can't understand others completely.

09:09.980 --> 09:12.360
Who knows if you can even
understand yourself?

09:12.360 --> 09:14.990
Understanding each other one hundred percent
is impossible.

09:15.360 --> 09:20.200
Of course, that's why we spend so much time
trying to understand ourselves and others.

09:20.200 --> 09:23.080
That's what makes life so interesting.

09:23.080 --> 09:25.040
Is that also true for you and Miss Misato?

09:26.040 --> 09:29.710
The word we use for "she" literally
means "the woman far away".

09:29.710 --> 09:33.670
To us, women will always be
on the distant shore.

09:33.670 --> 09:38.470
Basically, there's a river dividing men and
women, deeper and wider than the ocean.

09:38.470 --> 09:40.850
I don't understand adults.

09:41.810 --> 09:45.730
T minus 300 minutes to Unit 03 activation test.

09:46.190 --> 09:48.060
TEST SITE 2, MATSUHIRO

09:46.810 --> 09:48.650
Main power supply, no problems.

09:48.440 --> 09:50.400
TEMPORARY UNDERGROUND CAGE (UNMANNED)

09:48.650 --> 09:50.650
Second apoptosis is nominal.

09:50.440 --> 09:52.610
SAME SURFACE FACILITY

09:50.650 --> 09:52.980
Coolant systems are normal in all sectors.

09:52.980 --> 09:55.070
Repairs to left arm crimp lock completed.

09:53.860 --> 09:56.610
EVA UNIT-03 ACTIVATION EXPERIMENT
INTEGRATED CONTROL POSITION

09:55.070 --> 09:57.610
Roger. Team B, commence operation.

09:56.820 --> 09:58.990
ON BOARD CENTRAL GENERAL
COMMAND VEHICLE

09:57.610 --> 10:00.240
No problems detected in
the data link to Unit 01.

10:00.240 --> 10:02.700
It could even go into combat as is.

10:02.700 --> 10:04.700
Really? That's nice.

10:05.000 --> 10:06.620
Now that was a half-hearted reply.

10:06.620 --> 10:10.880
You know, once this unit is cleared for duty,
it'll be assigned directly under your command.

10:10.880 --> 10:13.090
The exclusive control of four Evas...

10:13.710 --> 10:16.420
If you wanted to, you could destroy the world.

10:17.590 --> 10:19.890
Have you told Shinji yet?

10:19.890 --> 10:21.890
I will when the test is over.

10:22.640 --> 10:24.600
The Fourth Child has arrived.

10:24.600 --> 10:27.980
Second squad, begin readying
the entry vehicle immediately.

10:29.850 --> 10:32.190
He's not here yet, is he, Asuka?

10:33.270 --> 10:35.190
He may not be coming today.

10:36.400 --> 10:38.780
I thought we might finally eat together today...

10:39.780 --> 10:40.570
Do you want this?

10:42.450 --> 10:46.040
Unit 03's already in Japan, isn't it?

10:46.040 --> 10:49.290
Yeah, I think it got here yesterday.

10:49.290 --> 10:52.590
Must be nice. I wonder who's going to pilot it?

10:53.290 --> 10:57.050
Maybe it's Toji? He's absent today, after all.

10:57.050 --> 10:58.470
No way!

11:00.050 --> 11:02.470
Entry plug fixed in place.

11:02.470 --> 11:04.350
Initiating first connection.

11:04.350 --> 11:05.640
Transmitting pulse.

11:05.640 --> 11:07.020
Graph readout is normal.

11:07.020 --> 11:09.230
Checklist cleared up to 1350.

11:09.230 --> 11:11.020
No problems found in initial contact phase.

11:11.020 --> 11:13.900
Roger. Shift the operation to phase two.

11:13.900 --> 11:15.730
All nerve links are normal.

11:15.730 --> 11:17.690
Checklist cleared up to 2550.

11:17.690 --> 11:20.150
All harmonics are normal.

11:20.150 --> 11:22.410
We are now exceeding the absolute border.

11:24.950 --> 11:26.910
Abort the test! Break the circuit!

11:29.290 --> 11:31.670
No good! High energy readings
detected in body!

11:31.670 --> 11:32.670
Impossible!

11:34.290 --> 11:35.090
An Angel?!

11:55.270 --> 11:57.440
An explosion has occurred in Matsushiro.

11:57.440 --> 11:58.730
Damage level unknown.

11:58.730 --> 12:01.610
Send the rescue squad and the Third Troop.

12:01.610 --> 12:04.110
Take care of it before the SSDF gets involved.

12:04.110 --> 12:04.950
Roger.

12:04.950 --> 12:07.410
Movement of an unidentified object
detected at the site.

12:07.410 --> 12:10.370
Pattern is orange. We can't
confirm it to be an Angel.

12:10.370 --> 12:12.920
Go to battle stations, Level One.

12:12.920 --> 12:15.040
All personnel, battle stations, Level One.

12:15.040 --> 12:16.840
Prepare for ground combat.

12:16.840 --> 12:18.590
Launch all Eva units!

12:18.590 --> 12:20.630
Dispatch immediately to intercept locations.

12:20.630 --> 12:22.880
Air transport is scheduled to go in twenty.

12:29.310 --> 12:31.180
An accident in Matsushiro?!

12:31.180 --> 12:34.100
No way! Then, are Miss Misato
and the others okay?!

12:34.400 --> 12:35.850
We can't contact them yet.

12:35.850 --> 12:38.150
No way. What will we do?

12:38.150 --> 12:40.320
What are you blubbering about?!

12:40.320 --> 12:43.650
Worrying about them right now
won't get us anywhere!

12:43.650 --> 12:45.990
But how can we fight the Angel by ourselves?

12:46.740 --> 12:50.040
Commander Ikari is taking direct command now.

12:50.040 --> 12:51.620
My father is?

12:51.620 --> 12:54.920
We have a visual of the target at Mt. Nobe.
Transferring to main monitor.

13:01.590 --> 13:03.470
As I thought...

13:03.470 --> 13:05.680
Transmit the abort signal.

13:05.680 --> 13:07.510
Force eject the entry plug.

13:09.560 --> 13:13.770
Not working. Neither abort signal
nor plug ejection code accepted.

13:13.770 --> 13:14.940
What about the pilot?

13:14.940 --> 13:18.190
We still have respiratory and cardiac
response, but he's probably...

13:19.270 --> 13:22.400
Evangelion Unit 03 will be
abandoned at this time.

13:22.400 --> 13:25.610
It will be designated as the Thirteenth Angel.

13:25.610 --> 13:26.860
But, Sir!

13:26.860 --> 13:29.530
Deploy the battle line at Mt. Nobe as planned.

13:29.530 --> 13:30.910
Destroy the target.

13:33.120 --> 13:34.500
Target is approaching.

13:35.580 --> 13:37.580
All units prepare for ground combat.

13:38.540 --> 13:39.960
No way!

13:39.960 --> 13:42.340
An Angel? Is that an Angel?!

13:42.340 --> 13:44.340
Correct, that is the target.

13:44.970 --> 13:47.550
You said that this is the target,

13:47.550 --> 13:49.140
but it's an Eva, isn't it?!

13:50.600 --> 13:52.350
But that's...

13:52.350 --> 13:54.560
How could it have been taken over by an Angel?

13:54.560 --> 13:59.100
I wonder if it's piloted by a human too?
A child our age?

13:59.100 --> 14:01.980
You still don't know?! The pilot of Unit 03 is...

14:03.110 --> 14:04.030
Asuka?

14:09.490 --> 14:10.660
Asuka?!

14:15.540 --> 14:17.580
Eva Unit 02 has gone silent!

14:17.580 --> 14:19.880
The pilot has ejected. Recovery squad
is heading for retrieval.

14:19.880 --> 14:21.750
Target is moving towards Unit 00!

14:21.960 --> 14:25.920
Rei, avoid close range combat
and stop the target.

14:25.920 --> 14:27.340
I'm sending Unit 01 over now.

14:27.340 --> 14:28.090
Roger.

14:44.610 --> 14:46.780
He's in there.

15:03.500 --> 15:05.960
The Angel is invading Unit 00's left arm.

15:05.960 --> 15:07.710
The nerve systems are being corrupted.

15:08.050 --> 15:10.180
Sever the left arm. Quickly!

15:10.180 --> 15:12.680
But if we don't cut the neural connections first...

15:12.680 --> 15:14.470
Sever it.

15:14.470 --> 15:14.970
Yes, Sir.

15:31.360 --> 15:34.490
Unit 00 is severely damaged.
The pilot is wounded.

15:34.490 --> 15:35.530
No way...

15:35.530 --> 15:36.870
The target is approaching you.

15:36.870 --> 15:40.210
It will contact you in twenty.
You must destroy it.

15:40.210 --> 15:42.330
But this target is...

15:47.420 --> 15:49.420
Isn't there a person in there?

15:53.930 --> 15:55.800
Another child my own age.

16:17.700 --> 16:19.370
An entry plug!

16:19.370 --> 16:21.330
There is a person in there, just as I thought.

16:37.470 --> 16:39.560
Problems in life support!

16:39.560 --> 16:41.390
The pilot's in danger!

16:41.390 --> 16:44.390
Not good! Cut the synch rate to 60%!

16:44.390 --> 16:45.270
Wait!

16:45.270 --> 16:48.230
But Ikari, at this rate, the pilot will die.

16:48.230 --> 16:50.650
Shinji, why don't you fight?

16:50.650 --> 16:53.950
But there's a person in there, Father!

16:53.950 --> 16:56.950
Irrelevant! It is an Angel! Our enemy!

16:56.950 --> 16:59.620
But... but I can't!

16:59.620 --> 17:02.660
I've got to save them! I can't just kill somebody!

17:02.660 --> 17:04.160
You'll die.

17:04.160 --> 17:06.750
I don't care! It's better than killing someone!

17:07.920 --> 17:12.010
Never mind! Cut all synchronization
between the pilot and Unit 01.

17:12.010 --> 17:13.130
Cut it?

17:13.130 --> 17:16.470
Correct. Switch the control circuit
to the dummy plug.

17:16.470 --> 17:19.560
But the dummy system still has
a lot of problems,

17:19.560 --> 17:21.640
and without Dr. Akagi's approval...

17:21.640 --> 17:25.100
It'll be of more use than the pilot. Do it!

17:25.100 --> 17:26.310
Yes, Sir.

17:37.110 --> 17:38.820
What is this?

17:40.410 --> 17:42.370
What did you do, Father?!

17:42.370 --> 17:44.450
Reception of the signal, confirmed.

17:44.450 --> 17:46.750
Control system switch is complete.

17:46.750 --> 17:49.590
All nerves linked directly to the dummy system.

17:49.590 --> 17:53.920
32.8% of Emotional Elements are unclear.
They can't be monitored.

17:53.920 --> 17:57.180
Irrelevant. Release the system.
Commence attack.

18:18.360 --> 18:21.410
This is the power of the dummy plug?

18:21.410 --> 18:22.950
System status nominal.

18:22.950 --> 18:24.540
Gain still increasing.

19:16.250 --> 19:17.960
Stop it!

19:19.470 --> 19:22.640
Father, stop! Stop doing this!

19:23.180 --> 19:25.720
Damn! Stop!

19:25.720 --> 19:30.100
Stop it! Stop it! Stop it! Stop it! Stop it!

19:39.190 --> 19:40.150
Stop!

19:41.950 --> 19:45.780
STOP!

19:52.830 --> 19:56.130
Eva Unit 03, no, I mean,

19:56.750 --> 19:59.340
the target is completely silent.

20:06.930 --> 20:08.680
I'll make this.

20:08.680 --> 20:13.190
Kodama, Nozomi, and I...
This recipe is for four.

20:13.980 --> 20:16.440
I wonder if he'll eat it tomorrow?

20:16.440 --> 20:19.940
We've found a survivor over here too!
He's still breathing!

20:17.440 --> 20:21.860
Third squad, erase 807 data
as soon as possible.

20:19.940 --> 20:21.860
Send help right away!

20:25.620 --> 20:28.540
Second squad, please hurry and check
for survivors in the linear block.

20:27.370 --> 20:28.740
Am I still alive?

20:30.580 --> 20:31.960
Kaji?

20:31.960 --> 20:34.170
You were lucky, Katsuragi.

20:34.830 --> 20:38.040
Where's Ritsuko?

20:38.040 --> 20:39.670
Don't worry.

20:39.670 --> 20:41.170
She wasn't hurt as bad as you.

20:41.880 --> 20:43.050
I see.

20:43.720 --> 20:45.430
What about Eva Unit 03?

20:45.430 --> 20:49.010
It was apparently destroyed,
as an Angel, by Unit 01.

20:54.390 --> 20:58.860
I... I haven't told Shinji anything.

21:06.700 --> 21:08.660
Shinji...

21:08.660 --> 21:11.540
Miss Misato, so you're all right?

21:11.540 --> 21:13.330
I...

21:13.330 --> 21:14.960
I'm sorry.

21:14.960 --> 21:20.300
I had something important to tell you, but...

21:20.300 --> 21:22.920
Miss Misato, I...

21:23.420 --> 21:25.300
I killed...

21:25.720 --> 21:27.510
It was my father...

21:27.510 --> 21:29.810
I begged him to stop, but...

21:30.470 --> 21:34.350
Shinji, I'm sorry. I'm sorry.

21:34.350 --> 21:36.480
Report from the entry plug recovery team.

21:36.480 --> 21:38.610
The pilot's life signs are confirmed.

21:38.610 --> 21:40.070
He's alive?!

21:40.070 --> 21:43.400
Unit 03's pilot is...

21:44.570 --> 21:46.700
The Fourth Child is...

21:47.410 --> 21:48.950
Toji?

21:49.450 --> 21:51.160
Shinji?

21:51.830 --> 21:53.410
Shinji?

21:53.410 --> 21:55.290
Shinji?!

21:55.290 --> 21:56.830
Shinji?!

21:56.830 --> 21:57.790
Shinji?!

21:57.830 --> 22:00.460
TO BE CONTINUED

23:05.900 --> 23:06.690
PREVIEW

23:06.820 --> 23:10.530
Shinji finally, of his own will,
quits as an Eva pilot.

23:10.530 --> 23:16.370
But regardless of his decision, the strongest of
the Angels attacks, giving rise to a new tragedy.

23:16.410 --> 23:18.710
Next time: "A Man's Battle"

23:19.410 --> 23:20.870
A MAN'S BATTLE
